*
!*/
!.gitignore
!fish/**
!ghostty/**
!herdr/config.toml
!herdr/flip
!herdr/harness-picker
!herdr/task-title
!herdr/test_task_title.py
!herdr/herdr-cheatsheet.*
!htop/**
!lazygit/**
!nvim/**
!tmux/**

# fish rewrites this itself; it is machine state, not config. EDITOR lives in
# fish/config.fish instead so it is visible and travels with the repo.
fish/fish_variables
tmux/plugins/
# Same for herdr's: `herdr plugin install` clones a git repo per plugin, and an
# embedded repo shows up as an untracked directory whatever the allowlist says.
herdr/plugins/
.DS_Store
